      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALEXANDRA THEGREAT (2) has had three runs this campaign and is yet to finish in the top three. Was again unable to find the frame last time when she finished eighth over 2130m at this track, beaten 11 metres. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Good enough to take out a race like this. SAVE THIS DANCE (4) was out of the money last start when 15 metres from the winner in fifth over 2190m at Northam. Best form reference might be his win at this track three starts back. Has the benefit of a good draw. Ideally placed and is sure to be there at the finish. ALTA HURRAH NZ (6) is better than his last-start seventh over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Worth considering. MAJOR BUZZ (3) ended last prep with a ninth at this track over 2130m nine weeks ago. Can open this campaign with a more positive effort.",
